---
import NoteFigure from './NoteFigure.astro';
---

<NoteFigure
  label="Lower-bound sketch"
  title="A tighter posterior approximation closes the evidence gap"
  caption="An editorial expansion of page 29's derivation. For fixed x and decoder θ, log pθ(x) is fixed and the ELBO lies below it by KL(qφ(z|x) || pθ(z|x)). The heights are qualitative, with no numerical scale or measured training trajectory. This posterior-gap KL differs from the KL to the prior inside the ELBO."
>
  <div class="elbo-panels">
    {[{ key: 'loose', title: 'Approximate posterior', level: 190, gap: 'Larger posterior gap' }, { key: 'tight', title: 'Closer to the true posterior', level: 117, gap: 'Smaller posterior gap' }].map((panel) => (
      <svg viewBox="0 0 340 320" role="img" aria-labelledby={`vae-elbo-${panel.key}-title vae-elbo-${panel.key}-desc`}>
        <title id={`vae-elbo-${panel.key}-title`}>{panel.title}</title>
        <desc id={`vae-elbo-${panel.key}-desc`}>The evidence remains fixed above the ELBO. Their gap is the KL divergence from the approximate posterior to the true model posterior. A closer posterior makes the bound tighter.</desc>
        <defs>
          <marker id={`vae-elbo-${panel.key}-arrow`} viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="arrow-head" /></marker>
        </defs>
        <text x="170" y="24" text-anchor="middle" class="heading">{panel.title}</text>
        <path d="M 40 243 V 49" class="axis" marker-end={`url(#vae-elbo-${panel.key}-arrow)`} />
        <text x="40" y="274" class="muted">Larger values upward</text>
        <line x1="64" x2="307" y1="80" y2="80" class="evidence" />
        <text x="64" y="64">Evidence · log pθ(x)</text>
        <line x1="64" x2="307" y1={panel.level} y2={panel.level} class="bound" />
        <text x="64" y={panel.level + 25} class="accent">ELBO · ℒθ,φ(x)</text>
        <path d={`M 284 86 V ${panel.level - 6}`} class="gap" marker-start={`url(#vae-elbo-${panel.key}-arrow)`} marker-end={`url(#vae-elbo-${panel.key}-arrow)`} />
        <text x="64" y="305" class="muted">{panel.gap}</text>
      </svg>
    ))}
  </div>
  <p class="gap-formula">Gap = KL(qφ(z|x) || pθ(z|x)) ≥ 0</p>
</NoteFigure>

<style>
  .elbo-panels { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
  svg { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 370px; height: auto; margin-inline: auto; }
  text { fill: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 14px; }
  .heading { font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; }
  .muted { fill: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .accent { fill: var(--accent); }
  .axis { fill: none; stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .evidence { stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 1.7; }
  .bound { stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .gap, .arrow-head { fill: none; stroke: var(--muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .gap-formula { margin: .6rem 0 0; text-align: center; font: 0.9rem var(--sans); color: var(--accent); }
  @container (max-width: 580px) { .elbo-panels { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; } }
</style>
